### ============ PART 1 - JPA AUDITING ============

### 1. Slide example: create "Dara" -> createdBy = admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/demo

### 2. Create a student as a specific user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: alice

{ "name": "Bopha", "email": "bopha@gmail.com", "age": 25, "gender": "Female", "major": "IT", "score": 88 }

### 3. Update it as another user -> lastModifiedBy = bob, createdBy stays alice
#    (replace 9 with the id returned by step 2)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/9
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: bob

{ "name": "Bopha Chan", "email": "bopha@gmail.com", "age": 25, "gender": "Female", "major": "IT", "score": 95 }

### 4. Seeded rows were created by "system"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1

### 5. Category also extends BaseEntity -> same audit columns
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: carol

{ "categoryName": "Monitor" }


### ============ PART 2 - CRITERIA API ============

### 6. Raw Criteria API: age > 20
GET http://localhost:8080/api/criteria/students/older-than?age=20

### 7. SQL slide: score >= 50 AND major = 'IT' ORDER BY score DESC
GET http://localhost:8080/api/criteria/students/top?major=IT&minScore=50


### ============ PART 3 - JPA SPECIFICATION ============

### 8. BEFORE: derived queries
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search/derived?name=Dara&age=22

### 9. Slide: WHERE category = 'Laptop'
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/by-category?category=Laptop

### 10. Dynamic search - no filters (returns all)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search

### 11. Dynamic search - name only (case-insensitive LIKE)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search?name=dar

### 12. Dynamic search - all 3 filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search?name=a&gender=Female&age=20

### 13. Advanced: composed specs + paging + sorting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search/advanced?major=IT&minScore=50&sortBy=score&direction=DESC&page=0&size=3

### 14. Products: composed specs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?category=Laptop&minPrice=1000&maxPrice=1500
